      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, Kāne golpeó una roca con su bastón y brotó agua dulce.",
          "en": "Last time, Kāne struck a rock with his staff, and fresh water gushed out."
        },
        {
          "es": "El mundo ya tenía gente, comida y agua dulce. Pero un niño llamado Māui sentía que algo faltaba.",
          "en": "The world now had people, food and fresh water. But a boy named Māui thought something was missing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Māui era el menor de cuatro hermanos. En el canto familiar antiguo, los cuatro se llaman Māui.",
          "en": "Māui was the youngest of four brothers. In the old family chant, all four are named Māui."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su madre era Hina y su padre, Akalana. El canto la llama Hina del fuego.",
          "en": "Their mother was Hina, and their father was Akalana. The chant calls her Hina of the fire."
        },
        {
          "es": "Māui se haría famoso por sus trucos y por un viaje de pesca enorme.",
          "en": "Māui would become famous for his tricks, and for one very big fishing trip."
        }
      ],
