      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Una mañana, Māui corrió a la playa y saltó a la canoa de sus hermanos.",
          "en": "One morning, Māui ran down to the beach and leaped into his brothers’ canoe."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡Esta canoa es muy chica para otro Māui!», gritaron. Y lo echaron al mar.",
          "en": "“This canoe is too small for another Māui!” they shouted. They threw him into the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esa tarde volvieron con un solo tiburón. Māui los esperaba.",
          "en": "That evening, they came home with just one shark. Māui was waiting for them."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Conmigo», dijo, «habrían atrapado al gran ʻulua, el pez más grande y fuerte».",
          "en": "“With me,” he said, “you would have caught the great ʻulua, the biggest, strongest fish.”"
        }
      ],
