      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al fin, los hermanos lo dejaron ir. Remaron lejos, hasta perder la tierra de vista.",
          "en": "At last, the brothers let him come along. They paddled far out, until the land was gone."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pescaron todo el día. Solo atraparon tiburones.",
          "en": "They fished all day. They caught only sharks."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¿Dónde está tu gran ʻulua, Māui?», se rieron.",
          "en": "“Where is your great ʻulua, Māui?” they laughed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Māui solo sonrió. Sacó su anzuelo mágico y le ató el ʻalae como carnada.",
          "en": "Māui only smiled. He pulled out his magic hook and tied the ʻalae to it as bait."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cantó: «Cuando suelte mi anzuelo con poder divino, atraparé al gran ʻulua».",
          "en": "He chanted, “When I let go my hook with divine power, I will catch the great ʻulua.”"
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces lo soltó. El anzuelo se hundió en el agua oscura.",
          "en": "Then he let go. The hook sank into the dark water."
        }
      ],
