        {
          "es": "Durante dos días, la tierra arrastró la canoa por el mar abierto.",
          "en": "For two days, the land pulled the canoe across the open sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los hermanos remaron con todas sus fuerzas, y Māui recogía la cuerda.",
          "en": "The brothers paddled with all their strength, and Māui hauled in the line."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por fin, la cuerda empezó a aflojarse. La tierra estaba subiendo.",
          "en": "At last, the line began to go slack. The land was rising."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡Sigan remando!», gritó Māui. «¡Pero no miren atrás, o perderemos la tierra!»",
          "en": "“Keep pulling!” shouted Māui. “But do not look back, or the land will be lost!”"
        }
